#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""High-level visible OpenCode TUI dispatch wrapper.

This is the formal control-plane entry for user-visible OpenCode TUI work.
It writes only framework state under .omx/framework/team/visible-runs and
delegates actual TUI API submit to bin/omx_opencode_tui_adapter.
"""

